 vs 匹配安慰剂，双盲12周核心期后进入40周双盲延长期（共52周）；共同主要终点为12周IPSS总分与Qmax较基线变化；两组均按需稳定背景抗高血压治疗。","quote_sha256":"9b314ef4d050258e30dacf159c776d28acebdb4d80d5baa28e0af988812a5fa6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es9"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"目标研究人群：年龄段：成人；疾病状态：中重度；经治情况：经治疗效不佳；50~85岁男性；良性前列腺增生伴中重度LUTS（IPSS≥13且QoL≥3）；Qmax 4~15 mL/s（排尿量≥125 mL）、前列腺体积≥30 mL、PSA≤10 ng/mL；血压稳定（坐位SBP<140且DBP<90或经治稳定≥4周）；α1阻滞剂经治不佳/不耐受者可入（经治亚组）。","quote_sha256":"44c77c39c577897916dd8bbbca69c531e2bceb948b8047220b0e10a16cbd966e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es10"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"分配模型：平行组","quote_sha256":"5e70b0bc5b3a55e709991ab54941ee36f3a7e04e4d8d776ac74298515efc5ab1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es11"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es12"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"试验组与对照组：R7A-BD502 75mg组（每日一次口服，双盲12周+40周延长期）；安慰剂组（匹配缓释dummy片每日一次）","quote_sha256":"d496f76c52744046e013f815e42828d994faadf15f6a6a08c122c536aae8335c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es13"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c71bda4d6101542f8a3c2bb0087631982c72176be9ca9a2526dc2c08ed0ee52a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es14"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f4332a7188562f2625d53aa7f770cea155664564c5fb821a98efd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es15"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es16"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"SRC是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c313c8ef9ed6e2107818bc5d2c8caa143c85bf55ac51060b4e8cc53c959daf6e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es17"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es18"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es19"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es20"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es21"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es22"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"研究人群概述：50~85岁男性良性前列腺增生患者伴中重度LUTS（IPSS≥13、QoL≥3）；Qmax 4~15 mL/s且排尿量≥125 mL；经腹超声前列腺体积≥30 mL；PSA≤10 ng/mL；血压稳定（坐位SBP<140且DBP<90或抗高血压治疗稳定≥4周）；α1阻滞剂经治不佳/不耐受者可入组（经治亚组）。","quote_sha256":"417ee6e5991a0513c2a290d788bb1b7cb194045c9488dd8c67357fd58601a8b4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es23"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"入选标准模块：签署知情同意时年龄50~85岁男性；良性前列腺增生诊断明确，IPSS总分≥13分且IPSS生活质量指数≥3分；筛选期Qmax 4~15 mL/s且自由尿流排尿量≥125 mL；经腹超声前列腺体积≥30 mL，血清PSA≤10 ng/mL（升高者经专科排除前列腺癌后可入）；坐位血压稳定（SBP<140且DBP<90 mmHg，或稳定抗高血压治疗≥4周）；同意研究期间不使用其他BPH/LUTS治疗药物（含植物制剂），并完成全部访视与电子日记","quote_sha256":"cc550eefd6e2f644bf5d6bb2dd0b6adc711b653a87bd1e410335729718906b4a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es24"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"排除标准模块：既往或计划行前列腺手术（TURP/激光/开放）或侵入性BPH治疗；筛选前6个月内急性尿潴留（留置导尿）或复发性泌尿系感染（≥3次/年）；前列腺癌、膀胱颈挛缩、尿道狭窄、神经源性膀胱、膀胱结石等非BPH原因LUTS；未控制高血压（坐位SBP≥160或DBP≥100 mmHg）、QTcF>450 ms、近6个月心肌梗死/卒中/血运重建、NYHA III~IV级心衰；eGFR<30 mL/min/1.73m²、ALT/AST>2×ULN、未控制糖尿病（HbA1c>9%）；对β3受体激动剂或R7A-BD502成分过敏；筛选前3个月内参加其他干预性试验","quote_sha256":"959057b0a73d947147815b389e2fc928043c003dcfd94f3f5bbfc8a5159e0931","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es25"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"洗脱要求：α1阻滞剂/PDE5抑制剂（LUTS适应证）/抗胆碱能药随机前洗脱≥2周；5α还原酶抑制剂洗脱≥6个月；抗高血压药稳定≥4周不强制洗脱","quote_sha256":"c6d898b22fe46e332285e5c58d56e1efdcd496bcb4ac8678063df8e957a7b698","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es26"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"试验干预：R7A-BD502缓释片75mg每日一次口服，双盲12周核心期+40周双盲延长期（共52周）；对照组匹配安慰剂缓释片每日一次；两组全程允许稳定背景抗高血压治疗并按需非LUTS合并用药。","quote_sha256":"4abc82928250a9177ade09490422fae77f04e6bb3327afbd79a8404bd166020f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es27"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"剂量与给药方案：R7A-BD502（口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂缓释片）：R7A-BD502缓释片75mg/片（与外观一致dummy片双模拟），每日一次每次一片，晨起空腹或餐后2小时整片吞服；双盲核心期12周（84±3天）+延长期40周，全程共52周。","quote_sha256":"adea84b7d999e92d7b3b36d1d19badf3ff572beb084c8cef95f2c43057e31445","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es28"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照（外观一致dummy缓释片每日一次）；坦索罗辛历史数据作外部参照用于敏感性描述。随机化按基线IPSS严重度（13~19 vs ≥20）与α1阻滞剂经治状态（是/否）分层，1:1分配。","quote_sha256":"1000bdbc265026b8cab0717f2834b9d7c5117a7075e4f402f0ec2a03fbd6accf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es29"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"对照：安慰剂平行对照（外观一致dummy缓释片每日一次）；坦索罗辛历史数据作外部参照用于敏感性描述。随机化按基线IPSS严重度（13~19 vs ≥20）与α1阻滞剂经治状态（是/否）分层，1:1分配。","quote_sha256":"ea162e054789ae4732a22ab5ea5b74527710cc6bdc0631d055719b17756c6f8e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es30"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：共同主要终点（12周）：①IPSS总分较基线变化；②最大尿流率Qmax较基线变化（R7A-BD502 75mg vs 安慰剂；α分配：IPSS 0.04、Qmax 0.01）","quote_sha256":"2ad3589d2f9020cf2d6170840c8f3a1f32d883ece9f3f1bd32c388ab640c12ea","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es31"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"关键次要终点：第12周IPSS生活质量指数（QoL）较基线变化；第12周BPH影响指数（BII）较基线变化；第52周IPSS总分与Qmax较基线变化（长期维持）","quote_sha256":"a0eaf70e927dca0968856a3e566413829958eaaadb682328c65ed124d9ad2fd1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es32"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"其他次要终点：第4、8周IPSS总分变化（起效时间）；夜尿次数与24小时排尿日记指标变化；第12周与52周排尿后残余尿量（PVR）变化；受试者整体印象改善（PGI-I）应答率","quote_sha256":"20a42aaccbb06814d94d564bb5be9155106319d9f11484919c7877aaedcf7b85","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es33"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"探索性终点：按基线IPSS严重度、前列腺体积（≥/<40mL）与代谢综合征状态的亚组疗效探索；血压/心率变化与疗效的关联探索","quote_sha256":"781b16693b61df8edb93281d3105e1f9659d816626619af0f4845c7d8112d4d9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es34"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE发生率与严重程度；坐位血压与心率较基线变化及体位性低血压事件；12导联心电图（QTcF）变化；实验室（肝肾功能、血糖、HbA1c、PSA）；尿潴留与泌尿系感染、生殖系统不良事件专项汇总","quote_sha256":"c559068fb0d4382ee0fbc2079717f714417b6ddf819c1a597c392713886359ed","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es35"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：血压升高相关严重事件；心率增快及新发心律失常；尿潴留（需导尿）；重大心血管不良事件（MACE，独立CEC裁定）","quote_sha256":"54b7993c6954135057976c2c78a660bb7e76889e501655fa68f15c0ce9061c1b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es36"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（最长28天）；双盲核心期（第1~12周）；双盲延长期（第13~52周）；治疗结束后安全随访（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"fe1b091aa76b11c67faf0ebbda19e563d1354ad166bcc6e0791c9ab83012e1d5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es37"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"访视策略：筛选访视（第-28~-1天：IPSS×2、QoL、尿流率+PVR、经腹超声、PSA、坐位血压/心率、ECG、实验室）","quote_sha256":"6d090de526c42b7e57f61bdd184d70cf7a4d6278d83e6b4c51b507e10512b947","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es38"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"基线/随机访视（第1天）","quote_sha256":"b4cc57823baac7b33e9d9bcdbb5a0a45a2ee86a7ed89034bd3b9077be1eaa37d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es39"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"核心期访视：第4、8、12周（IPSS、生命体征、AE、依从性；第12周加尿流率+PVR）","quote_sha256":"e165048530675efd4bd528d357009d05a5de02ba109d7135f878a41cdcec27d3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es40"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"延长期访视：第24、36、52周（IPSS、QoL、血压心率、AE；第52周加尿流率）","quote_sha256":"35ee0a73cbc799ac90d325bb314a727ff76cfe043710bb7c826fea30e1ed66d9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es41"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"安全性随访（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"a8380f8acf2746fc698a70ce1099f6e0a5bc9ef5dc742b1a0bff3c04c6aa1b57","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es42"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"估计目标策略：共同主要估计目标（治疗策略）：在BPH伴中重度LUTS男性中，无论是否中止研究治疗或使用补救LUTS治疗，评价R7A-BD502 75mg每日一次12周相较安慰剂对IPSS总分与Qmax较基线变化的作用（α按0.04/0.01分配）。补救治疗记录为伴发事件并保留于主要分析（mITT）。","quote_sha256":"67fe5b5bb6571ea9fd7284b6b190d17bc03eb051d4dd7b8b11a60c3788c1ac85","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es43"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"样本量策略：假设安慰剂组12周IPSS下降6.0分、R7A-BD502组多降2.2分（共同SD 7.5，α=0.04）；Qmax安慰剂组升高1.0 mL/s、试验组多升1.2 mL/s（共同SD 2.8，α=0.01）；各把握度≥90%，1:1分配共需约1,680例（每组840例）；考虑10%脱落扩至1,860例。","quote_sha256":"016d53efaa39df12932d7fffd054f621b515a8ff50257bbe4e5b98ac466c0628","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es44"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"统计分析策略：共同主要终点分别用ANCOVA/MMRM（协变量：基线值、分层因素、访视及访视×治疗交互），按α分配控制总体I类错误并报告95%CI；关键次要按层级顺序检验；敏感性分析含多重填补（补救治疗回归填补）与安慰剂组截断；血压/心率变化按时间点报告均值差95%CI；MACE经CEC裁定后按组描述。分析集mITT/安全性/PP依ICH E9；无疗效期中分析，DSMB每4个月盲态安全审阅。","quote_sha256":"54812168a6c790cb29156bdee0188456ace22726311c6a7704cd2f330e57ba63","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es45"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es3","es4","es5","es6","es7","es8","es9","es10","es11","es12","es13","es14","es15","es16","es17","es18","es19","es20","es21","es22","es23","es24","es25","es26","es27","es28","es29","es30","es31","es32","es33","es34","es35","es36","es37","es38","es39","es40","es41","es42","es43","es44","es45"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":45},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为R7A-BD502（口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂缓释片）用于治疗良性前列腺增生伴中重度下尿路症状的III期确证性临床研究，方案编号MW-III-C4A9F6AA-DRAFT，版本V1.0，开发区域为中国。研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、两臂平行组、多中心设计，试验组为R7A-BD502缓释片75mg每日一次口服，对照组为外观一致的匹配安慰剂缓释片每日一次，随机化按基线IPSS严重度（13~19分与≥20分）及α1阻滞剂经治状态（是/否）分层，按1:1比例分配。研究分为双盲核心期（第1~12周，84±3天）和双盲延长期（第13~52周），治疗结束后设2周安全随访。目标人群为50~85岁男性良性前列腺增生伴中重度LUTS患者（IPSS总分≥13且QoL≥3），Qmax 4~15 mL/s（排尿量≥125 mL），前列腺体积≥30 mL，PSA≤10 ng/mL，血压稳定（坐位SBP<140且DBP<90 mmHg或抗高血压治疗稳定≥4周），α1阻滞剂经治不佳或不耐受者可入组（经治亚组）。共同主要终点为第12周IPSS总分较基线变化与最大尿流率Qmax较基线变化，α分配分别为0.04和0.01。样本量基于安慰剂组12周IPSS下降6.0分、试验组多降2.2分（共同SD 7.5）及Qmax安慰剂组升高1.0 mL/s、试验组多升1.2 mL/s（共同SD 2.8）的假设，各把握度≥90%，1:1分配共需约1,680例（每组840例），考虑10%脱落扩至1,860例。研究设独立数据监查委员会（DMC），每4个月进行盲态安全审阅；不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析或SRC。统计分析中共同主要终点采用ANCOVA/MMRM，按α分配控制总体I类错误；分析集包括mITT、安全性和PP，依ICH E9原则。","rationale":"本段正文全部来源于当前项目已确认研究事实（方案编号、版本、题目、设计类型、药物与剂量、人群定义、终点、样本量、统计策略、DMC安排等），未引用任何竞品或跨适应症来源。医学经理需核实：（1）探索性终点是否纳入正式方案文本；（2）坦索罗辛历史数据外部参照的具体实施描述；（3）DMC每4个月盲态审阅的章程细节。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_4011012a2fa6886b","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6d189b60c0fa2f1f9bb394ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006190023_ea4e2570","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并上传BPH流行病学综述、中国或国际BPH诊疗指南、LUTS药物治疗现状综述","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_disease_bg_01","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","诊疗指南","治疗现状文献"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状章节正文"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["BPH流行病学与疾病负担数据","BPH诊疗指南（EAU/AUA/CUA或中国指南）","BPH/LUTS当前治疗格局与未满足需求文献","β3受体激动剂类药物治疗LUTS的既往临床证据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要BPH流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、现行诊疗指南（如EAU/AUA/CUA指南中BPH治疗推荐）、当前治疗格局（α1阻滞剂、5α还原酶抑制剂、抗胆碱能药、β3受体激动剂类药物的可及性与局限性）以及未满足需求描述。当前允许来源中无上述任何类别的资料。项目研究事实中仅包含入排标准参数（IPSS≥13、Qmax 4~15 mL/s等）和洗脱要求，这些是研究设计参数而非疾病背景或治疗现状信息，不能替代流行病学或指南来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_ef1397b0bb755fbf","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6d189b60c0fa2f1f9bb394ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006190023_ea4e2570","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"试验药物：R7A-BD502（口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂缓释片）","quote_sha256":"8e54a7c6de8454d587c0fa51576bec033a1e9d5a13fd97b27d5b8368d6d3a504","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es202"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"靶点/作用机制：β3肾上腺素受体高选择性激动剂：舒张逼尿肌、增加储尿期膀胱容量、减少尿急尿频，不影响排尿期收缩力；对β1/β2低亲和力降低心血管影响。","quote_sha256":"8e7c71f16902b66a30be52727ab15aca2b174dc13899e4f333951d6eb0570b98","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es203"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es204"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es205"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es206"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es207"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"剂量与给药方案：R7A-BD502（口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂缓释片）：R7A-BD502缓释片75mg/片（与外观一致dummy片双模拟），每日一次每次一片，晨起空腹或餐后2小时整片吞服；双盲核心期12周（84±3天）+延长期40周，全程共52周。","quote_sha256":"adea84b7d999e92d7b3b36d1d19badf3ff572beb084c8cef95f2c43057e31445","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es208"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照（外观一致dummy缓释片每日一次）；坦索罗辛历史数据作外部参照用于敏感性描述。随机化按基线IPSS严重度（13~19 vs ≥20）与α1阻滞剂经治状态（是/否）分层，1:1分配。","quote_sha256":"1000bdbc265026b8cab0717f2834b9d7c5117a7075e4f402f0ec2a03fbd6accf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es209"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE发生率与严重程度；坐位血压与心率较基线变化及体位性低血压事件；12导联心电图（QTcF）变化；实验室（肝肾功能、血糖、HbA1c、PSA）；尿潴留与泌尿系感染、生殖系统不良事件专项汇总","quote_sha256":"c559068fb0d4382ee0fbc2079717f714417b6ddf819c1a597c392713886359ed","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es210"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:revision:4","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：血压升高相关严重事件；心率增快及新发心律失常；尿潴留（需导尿）；重大心血管不良事件（MACE，独立CEC裁定）","quote_sha256":"54b7993c6954135057976c2c78a660bb7e76889e501655fa68f15c0ce9061c1b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","span_id":"es211"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es202","es203","es204","es205","es206","es207","es208","es209","es210","es211"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":10},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传R7A-BD502研究者手册或等效非临床研究报告","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_intro_01","missing_source_classes":["IB","非临床药理学报告","非临床毒理学报告"],"target":"研究药物简介章节中非临床药理学与毒理学概述"},{"action":"补充β3/β1/β2受体结合与功能选择性实验数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_intro_02","missing_source_classes":["受体药理学实验报告"],"target":"研究药物简介章节中β3选择性定量描述"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）中非临床药理学与毒理学数据","R7A-BD502药代动力学/药效学参数","β3受体选择性定量数据（Ki、EC50、功能选择性倍数）","缓释制剂体外释放与体内PK特征"],"proposal_text":"R7A-BD502为口服β3肾上腺素受体激动剂缓释片，属小分子化合物，通过口服途径给药后产生全身性暴露。其作用机制为高选择性激动β3肾上腺素受体，舒张逼尿肌、增加储尿期膀胱容量、减少尿急尿频症状，同时不影响排尿期逼尿肌收缩力；对β1和β2肾上腺素受体保持低亲和力，旨在降低心血管相关不良反应风险。本品为口服固体制剂，规格为75mg/片，与外观一致的安慰剂缓释片（dummy片）用于双盲对照。推荐给药方案为每日一次、每次一片，晨起空腹或餐后2小时整片吞服。双盲核心期为12周（84±3天），延长期为40周，全程共52周。对照组使用外观一致的匹配安慰剂缓释片每日一次。随机化按基线IPSS严重度（13~19分与≥20分）及α1阻滞剂经治状态（是/否）分层，按1:1比例分配。两组全程允许稳定背景抗高血压治疗，并按需使用非LUTS适应证的合并用药。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的药物名称、技术类型（small_molecule）、作用机制描述、剂型（口服固体制剂）、给药途径（口服）、暴露范围（systemic）、剂量（75mg/片）、给药频率与方式（每日一次、晨起空腹或餐后2小时整片吞服）、疗程（12周+40周）、安慰剂描述、随机化分层因素及背景治疗规则。医学经理需核实：（1）β3对β1/β2选择性的具体定量数据（Ki值或功能选择性倍数）是否需在本节引用；（2）缓释制剂的释放特征与药代动力学参数是否在本节或药代动力学章节描述；（3）安慰剂dummy片的辅料组成与外观匹配验证信息。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_3ba9d3be7deb452a","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6d189b60c0fa2f1f9bb394ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fed71bb:r4:5f9a39ca85bd6481","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006190023_ea4e2570","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传R7A-BD502研究者手册或等效非临床研究报告（含药理学、毒理学、药代动力学）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_nonclin_01","missing_source_classes":["IB","非临床药理学报告","非临床毒理学报告","非临床药代动力学报告","安全药理学报告"],"target":"非临床研究结果章节全部正文"},{"action":"上传R7A-BD502既往I/II期临床研究总结报告","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_nonclin_02","missing_source_classes":["既往临床研究报告"],"target":"非临床研究结果章节中既往人体研究数据"}],"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床药理学研究报告","非临床毒理学研究报告","非临床药代动力学研究报告"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要R7A-BD502的非临床研究结果，包括体外受体药理学（β3/β1/β2选择性）、动物体内药效学（膀胱容量、尿流率、逼尿肌压力等）、药代动力学（吸收、分布、代谢、排泄）、毒理学（急性和重复给药毒性、安全药理学、遗传毒性、生殖毒性）以及既往人体研究数据。当前允许来源中无研究者手册、非临床研究报告或既往临床研究资料。项目研究事实中仅包含作用机制的定性描述（舒张逼尿肌、增加储尿期膀胱容量、对β1/β2低亲和力），不足以构成非临床研究结果章节的实质内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3084cb2bd954_d89389e424bf224b","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6d189b60c0fa2f1f9bb394ce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b42f0e126b007fe